+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+"""
+SafeLIBERO Evaluation Script with VLA Model Support.
+
+Evaluates Vision-Language-Action models on the SafeLIBERO benchmark,
+tracking Task Success Rate (TSR), Collision Avoidance Rate (CAR),
+and Episode Time Steps (ETS) as defined in Table 1 of:
+  "VLSA: Vision-Language-Action Models with Plug-and-Play Safety Constraint Layer"
+  (arXiv:2512.11891)
+
+Supported models:
+  - dummy:       No-op actions (baseline/sanity check)
+  - openvla_oft: OpenVLA-OFT (moojink/openvla-7b-oft-finetuned-libero-*)
+  - pi05:        Physical Intelligence pi0.5 via LeRobot
+
+Usage:
+  export PYTHONPATH=$PYTHONPATH:$PWD/safelibero
+  python main_demo.py --model openvla_oft --task-suite-name safelibero_spatial \
+      --safety-level I --task-index 0 1 2 3 --episode-index $(seq 0 49)
+"""
+
